{
  "title": "Vitalis 晚报 · 二头肌弯举总次数增加",
  "content": "<div style=\"max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px 12px 18px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#eef3f3;color:#14202b;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word\">\n<div style=\"padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#0f3d3a;color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#9fd3c9\">VITALIS · 晚报</p><h1 style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.35;color:#ffffff\">二头肌弯举总次数增加</h1><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#c5e3dd\">2026-10-07 · 数据截至 2026-10-07 21:20 · 合成数据</p></div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:10px 16px;background:#fff6e5;border:1px solid #f1dfb6;border-radius:12px\">\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">晚报仅汇总截至所示时间已同步的训练和活动；未同步或之后的训练尚未计入。</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:16px 0 0\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">关键记录</h2>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#55636f\">睡眠时长</p><p style=\"margin:2px 0 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;color:#14202b;word-break:keep-all\">7 小时 26 分钟</p><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:0 7px;border-radius:999px;background:#eef2f4;color:#4a5964;font-weight:600\">↓ 0.3%</span> <span style=\"color:#7a8892\">个人参照 · 7 小时 28 分钟</span></p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#7a8892\">入睡 23:10；醒来 07:00；正常：在你近期的个人范围内。</p></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#55636f\">步数</p><p style=\"margin:2px 0 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;color:#14202b;word-break:keep-all\">6,076 步</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#7a8892\">今天还没过完，暂不和平时比较。</p></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#55636f\">力量训练时长</p><p style=\"margin:2px 0 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;color:#14202b;word-break:keep-all\">45 分钟</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#7a8892\">1 场</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">今天的变化</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">同样重量和组数下，二头肌弯举总次数较2026-10-04增加6次</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">力量训练</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:2px 0 6px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a8892\">2026-10-07 · 10-07 18:00 · 45 分钟</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">主观用力 RPE 7/10（Zepp 记录；越高越吃力）</p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">平均心率</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">108 次/分钟</span></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">本次训练估算热量</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">210 千卡</span></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">设备记录组数</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">12 组</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:12px 0 2px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;color:#14202b\">二头肌弯举</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">每手 10 kg · 3 组 · 12 / 10 / 8 次</p>\n<p style=\"margin:2px 0 6px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a8892\">对照 2026-10-04 · 同样重量和组数下，总次数增加 6 次。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:12px 0 2px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;color:#14202b\">高位下拉</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">器械标示 40 kg · 3 组 · 12 / 12 / 10 次</p>\n<p style=\"margin:12px 0 2px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;color:#14202b\">坐姿划船</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">器械标示 35 kg · 3 组 · 12 / 12 / 12 次</p>\n<p style=\"margin:12px 0 2px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;color:#14202b\">哑铃侧平举</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">每手 5 kg · 3 组 · 15 / 15 / 15 次</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">昨夜恢复背景</h2>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">睡眠 HRV</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">45.1 毫秒</span></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">睡眠静息心率</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">60.2 次/分钟</span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">日常活动与能量</h2>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">活动距离</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">4.25 公里</span></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">设备估算热量（统计范围待确认）</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">588 千卡</span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">日内记录</h2>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">平均压力评分</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">27</span></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">心率记录均值</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">69.1 次/分钟</span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">肌群分化回顾</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">本次已记录肌群：背部、肱二头肌、肩部</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">力量训练量与下次安排</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">二头肌弯举容量 300 kg·次（单手记录重量）。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">高位下拉容量 1,360 kg·次（器械标称重量）。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">坐姿划船容量 1,260 kg·次（器械标称重量）。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">哑铃侧平举容量 225 kg·次（单手记录重量）。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">本次记录 12 组，以下按动作估算肌群训练量。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">其中 12 组有明确重量容量。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">根据已记录动作，本次主要练到背部 6 组、肱二头肌 3 组、肩部 3 组；肱二头肌 6 组辅助参与。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">建议：先按已记录组数比较近期训练量；标记热身组可以进一步提高估算准确度。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">近期训练或已知不适限制了候选；先安排恢复性活动，不机械重复刚练过的部位。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:2px 0 6px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a8892\">同一组可涉及多个肌群，各肌群组数不能相加作为总组数；实际刺激随动作和用力变化。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:2px 0 6px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a8892\">缺少个人乳酸阈心率，未展示本次心率区间。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:2px 0 6px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a8892\">心率或圈段结构不足，未估计工作段和休息段。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:2px 0 6px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#7a8892\">未区分热身的组保留在训练量估算中；已标记热身组排除，估算不等于有效增肌组。</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">本周负荷</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">本周负荷目标 118，已完成 62（53%），进度正常</p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">本周还剩 56，留给接下来的</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">4 天</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">近 7 天对近 4 周负荷比 1.00（维持）</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#e2f1ee;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">明日重点</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">下次训练重点观察同样重量下的组次记录</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">明日安排暂定；以明早结合补齐的训练和昨夜恢复后的晨报为准。</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">记录曲线</h2>\n<div style=\"margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbe4e9;border-radius:8px\"><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#192e3b\">Zepp BioCharge · 总分、身体与心理</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#607280\">总分 · zepp · synthetic-chart-device：首个有记录时段 75，末个有记录时段 21.9</p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;colo